      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T04:59:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Adding the 1 at the end ensures that the padding gets added right after the init_task in memory. They are both placed in the same section in the address space right next to each other. When I don\u0027t initialize it (which sets the whole thing to 0), the pad goes to the uninitialized section and does not get placed right after init_task.",
